[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Full of Mistakes]
[00:00.62]Lesson 105 | 第105课
[00:03.10]Full of mistakes | 错误百出
[00:06.23]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.75]What was Sandra's present? | 桑德拉的礼物是什么？
[00:17.14]Where's Sandra, Bob? | 桑德拉在哪里，鲍勃？
[00:20.50]I want her. | 我找她。
[00:22.68]Do you want to speak to her? | 你想和她说话吗？
[00:26.64]Yes, I do. | 是的，我想。
[00:29.06]I want her to come to my office. | 我要她到我办公室来。
[00:33.11]Tell her to come at once. | 告诉她马上过来。
[00:36.69]Did you want to see me? | 你想见我吗？
[00:40.38]Ah, yes, Sandra. | 啊，是的，桑德拉。
[00:43.41]How do you spell 'intelligent'? | 'intelligent'怎么拼写？
[00:47.14]Can you tell me? | 你能告诉我吗？
[00:49.29]I-N-T-E-L-L-I-G-E-N-T. | I-N-T-E-L-L-I-G-E-N-T。
[01:00.32]That's right. | 对了。
[01:02.24]You've typed it with only one 'L'. | 你只打了一个'L'。
[01:06.44]This letter's full of mistakes. | 这封信错误百出。
[01:10.48]I want you to type it again. | 我要你再打一遍。
[01:14.68]Yes, I'll do that. | 好的，我会的。
[01:17.56]I'm sorry about that. | 对此我很抱歉。
[01:20.12]And here's a little present for you. | 这是给你的一份小礼物。
[01:23.46]What is it? | 这是什么？
[01:25.40]It's a dictionary. | 是本词典。
[01:27.56]I hope it'll help you. | 我希望它能帮到你。